  "notes": [
    "answers[questionId] = 1 + (k % 5) over diagnostic.json in dataset order.",
    "Unlike the pre-spine fixtures this one does NOT freeze the datasets: DGIW",
    "generators import a dozen JSON files between them and freezing them would",
    "mean the baseline stopped describing the module in production. The",
    "datasetFingerprint recorded in each baseline closes that gap - a dataset",
    "edit reports as its own finding instead of blaming a spine change.",
    "artefactId is not here: it is read from each generator exported constant.",
    "intake: G1 program-design fixture. Actionable (name + drivers + scope), so",
    "charter-pdf and operating-model-pdf-intake render engagement mode; the",
    "entries that omit it render reference mode under the ILLUSTRATIVE watermark.",
    "The third RACI row is deliberately unassigned and must never print.",
    "INTAKE-SCOPE (check/modules/dgiw.mjs) validates intake.scope.pillarIds here",
    "against pillars.json - the same fixture the harness drives.",
    "targets: G2 per-pillar target maturity fixture. TARGET-RANGE validates the",
    "keys against pillars.json and the values as integers 1..5. evidence + tier",
    "drive the AR-01 quick-tier golden entry; the deep entries carry none."
